      "type": "spotlight",
      "item": "tribalpower:spirit_cistern",
      "text": [
        "The camp's tank. It holds one fluid, up to **16,000 mB** (16 buckets), and it keeps its fluid when you pick it up, so you can move a full tank without spilling a drop."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Filling and reading it",
      "text": [
        "Right-click it with a bucket to fill or empty it. Right-click with an empty hand to read the fluid and amount.",
        "Standard fluid pipes, a Tide Pump or a fluid relay can fill and drain it. A second fluid will not go in until the tank is empty.",
        "A comparator facing away from it reads **0** when empty, then **1 to 15** as it fills.",
        "Crouch and right-click a face with an empty hand to set that face: Both, Input, Output or Closed. Touching Tribal Power machines move up to **250 mB** a second across a giving face into a taking one."
      ]
    },
