    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Good to know",
      "text": [
        "Relays and the Tide Pump move fluid; they are not tanks. Put a cistern at each end.",
        "A Wave Drum also keeps its own water tank when broken.",
        "[Spring Calling](spring_calling) can mark a placed cistern as a spring so it refills itself with water. Moving the block ends the spring; water already inside still rides on the item."
